  "body": [
    "Learn how the adoption of Agentic AI expands compliance and cybersecurity challenges, requiring a new approach to governance and risk management.",
    "In the digital age, financial sectors confront escalating cyber risks. Reply presents a strategic approach for DORA compliance, shedding light on the EU's Digital Operational Resilience Act.",
    "Meet the experts of Cluster Reply and Spike Reply at it-sa 2026 in Nuremberg and experience our expertise as a specialized security provider.",
    "Join Reply, alongside industry leaders from AWS, The National Cyber Security Centre and UK Financial Regulators for an exclusive session exploring the evolving cyber threat landscape and what effective resilience means for the UK Financial Services sector.",
    "Join Spike Reply and Fortinet for a hands-on cloud security workshop with live attack simulations and an interactive Capture the Flag challenge.",
    "At Hannover Messe, Spike Reply showcases innovative OT security solutions and AI-powered maintenance strategies to help achieve transparency, protection, and resilience.",
    "Discover also"
  ],
